<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY O/N RATES END LOWER AT 22.375 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY O/N RATES END LOWER AT 22.375 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's overnight interbank interest rates fell on Friday as liquidity returned to the market following the passing of the tax payment deadline, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates ended at 22.375 percent, down on Thursday's close of 23 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Thursday's stream of heavy takers has dried up,&quot; said Sandor Szatmari of Unicbank. &quot;I expect rates to fall further in the next few days to around 22 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (361) 327 4040</p>
